{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-03-09 23:30:00', 'title': 'SHAREHOLDER CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT FILED AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC., KASKELA LAW LLC ENCOURAGES INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM - MTCH', 'text': 'PHILADELPHIA , MARCH 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SHAREHOLDER FIRM KASKELA LAW LLC ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS BEEN FILED AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC. (NASDAQ: MTCH) ("MATCH" OR THE "COMPANY") ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED SHARES OF THE COMPANY\'S COMMON STOCK BETWEEN NOVEMBER 3, 2021 AND JANUARY 31, 2023 , INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"). INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED MATCH\'S COMMON STOCK DURING THE CLASS PERIOD AND SUFFERED AN INVESTMENT LOSS IN EXCESS OF $100,000 ARE ENCOURAGED TO IMMEDIATELY CONTACT KASKELA LAW LLC\xa0(D.'}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-03-09 13:30:00', 'title': 'INVESTOR ACTION NOTICE: THE SCHALL LAW FIRM ENCOURAGES INVESTORS IN MATCH GROUP, INC. WITH LOSSES OF $100,000 TO CONTACT THE FIRM', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, CA / ACCESSWIRE / MARCH 9, 2023 / THE SCHALL LAW FIRM, A NATIONAL SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS LITIGATION FIRM, REMINDS INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC. ("MATCH" OR "THE COMPANY") (NASDAQ:MTCH) FOR VIOLATIONS OF 10(B) AND 20(A) OF THE SECURITIES EXCHANGE ACT OF 1934 AND RULE 10B-5 PROMULGATED THEREUNDER BY THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION. INVESTORS WHO PURCHASED THE COMPANY\'S SECURITIES BETWEEN NOVEMBER 3, 2021 AND JANUARY 31, 2023, INCLUSIVE (THE \'\'CLASS PERIOD\'\'), ARE ENCOURAGED TO CONTACT THE FIRM BEFORE MAY 5, 2023.'}{'symbol': 'MTCH', 'date': '2023-03-09 10:37:00', 'title': 'FILED CLASS ACTION ANNOUNCEMENT: KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP HAS FILED A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC.', 'text': 'RADNOR, PA. , MARCH 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LAW FIRM OF KESSLER TOPAZ MELTZER & CHECK, LLP INFORMS INVESTORS THAT THE FIRM HAS FILED A SECURITIES CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST MATCH GROUP, INC. ("MATCH") ON BEHALF OF INVESTORS WHO